8,0,0,1,0,45,6,MinionPro-Regular,10.0,200.01,178.46,575.45,227.47,178.46,564.53,200.01,36.55,"network. Consequently, the BC network is segmented into distinct components i.e., CA nodes, BC storage, and smart contracts. The BC storage specifically holds cross-border access control policies designed for external vehicles. The BC network effectively creates a virtual coalition, uniting CA nodes from diverse countries."
