23,1,0,1,0,12,6,MinionPro-Bold,10.0,203.86,166.61,565.44,176.61,166.61,615.39,203.86,46.56,Integrity: It means to protect data from improper modification. The proposed framework
23,0,0,1,0,28,6,MinionPro-Regular,10.0,207.84,179.6,575.94,202.58,179.6,589.42,207.84,36.06,"uses integrity measurements provided by BC. The BC, SHA-256 cryptographic hash function is used to protect the vehicle and RSU platform data as well as data during communication."
23,1,0,1,0,13,6,MinionPro-Bold,10.0,203.86,211.63,556.45,221.63,211.63,570.37,203.86,55.55,Availability: It means to ensure that resources are accessible to users/vehicles and RSUs
23,0,0,1,0,36,6,MinionPro-Regular,10.0,207.84,224.61,575.49,260.57,224.61,531.43,207.84,36.51,"when required. The BC ledgers have a built-in replication mechanism. Therefore, a damaged node can restore its ledger’s data from other peer nodes. Furthermore, the proposed PoAI mechanism ensures system availability against DoS and DDoS attacks."
23,1,0,1,0,14,6,MinionPro-Bold,10.0,203.86,269.62,569.29,279.62,269.62,512.38,203.86,42.71,Authentication and Authorization: It means to ensure that the vehicle and RSU are legiti-
