23,0,0,1,0,61,6,MinionPro-Regular,10.0,207.84,443.61,575.93,505.6,443.61,286.4,207.84,36.07,"authentication by spoofing a legitimate user/vehicle ID. In the proposed framework “T.join” request consists of the user/vehicle platform hash and pseudonymous ID. The smart contract verifies the user’s platform hash from his country’s RCA. The RCA binds user/vehicle pseu- donymous IDs with the user’s platform hash during initial registration. As a result, it thwarts any attempt to initiate a spoofing attack."
